                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Xác Nhận Ngừng Dịch Vụ</h3>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Dịch vụ sẽ được ẩn khỏi danh mục đặt lịch mới (bảo toàn lịch sử cũ).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <input type="hidden" id="deleteSrvId" value="0" />
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mb-5 bg-white/5 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
                Bạn có chắc chắn muốn xóa / ngừng kinh doanh dịch vụ <strong id="deleteSrvName" class="text-rose-400"></strong> không?
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-end space-x-2 text-xs">
                <button type="button" onclick="closeModal('deleteServiceModal')" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-slate-300 font-semibold">Hủy</button>
                <button type="button" id="confirmDeleteServiceBtn" onclick="confirmDeleteService()" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-500 text-white font-bold shadow-lg shadow-rose-600/30 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                    <i id="deleteServiceSpinner" class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch fa-spin hidden"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-trash-can"></i>
                    <span>Xác nhận xóa</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal: Cấu hình Cổng gửi Gmail SMTP & SMS Gateway (Twilio/eSMS) -->
    <div id="gatewayConfigModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-md z-50 flex items-center justify-center hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 p-4">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-white/20 w-full max-w-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl relative transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
            <button type="button" onclick="closeModal('gatewayConfigModal')" class="absolute top-5 right-5 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xl"></i>
            </button>

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-5 pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 to-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30 shrink-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-tower-broadcast"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Cấu Hình Cổng Gửi Gmail SMTP & SMS Thật</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Nhập tài khoản Gmail (App Password 16 ký tự) và Twilio API để hệ thống gửi thư & SMS thật tới khách hàng.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form id="gatewayConfigForm" onsubmit="handleSaveGatewayConfig(event)" class="space-y-5 text-xs">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    <!-- Cột 1: Cấu hình Gmail SMTP -->
                    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-purple-500/30 space-y-3.5">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-bold text-purple-300 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-purple-400"></i> 1. Cấu hình Gmail (MailKit SMTP)
                            </span>
                            <span id="modalEmailStatusBadge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-semibold">Chưa cấu hình</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-[11px] text-slate-300 space-y-1">
                            <p class="font-semibold text-purple-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1"></i> Hướng dẫn lấy Mật khẩu ứng dụng Gmail (1 phút):</p>
                            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-0.5 text-slate-400">
                                <li>Bật xác minh 2 bước cho Gmail của bạn.</li>
                                <li>Truy cập <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-400 underline hover:text-cyan-300 font-semibold">myaccount.google.com/apppasswords</a></li>
                                <li>Tạo App Password mới và dán chuỗi <b>16 ký tự</b> vào ô bên dưới.</li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                            <div class="col-span-2">
                                <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">SMTP Server</label>
                                <input type="text" id="cfgSmtpServer" value="smtp.gmail.com" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">Port</label>
                                <input type="number" id="cfgSmtpPort" value="587" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white" />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">Tên thương hiệu hiển thị</label>
                            <input type="text" id="cfgSenderName" value="SalonCare Spa & Beauty" placeholder="SalonCare Spa & Beauty" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white" />
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">Địa chỉ Gmail gửi đi <span class="text-rose-400">*</span></label>
                            <input type="email" id="cfgEmailUsername" placeholder="VD: hieudzzzggg@gmail.com" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500" />
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">Mật khẩu ứng dụng Google (16 ký tự) <span class="text-rose-400">*</span></label>
                            <input type="password" id="cfgEmailPassword" placeholder="Nhập 16 ký tự App Password (vd: abcd efgh ijkl mnop)" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500" />
                        </div>

                        <!-- Gửi thử Email -->
                        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-white/10">
                            <label class="block text-slate-400 mb-1">Gửi thử Email kiểm tra tới:</label>
                            <div class="flex gap-2">
                                <input type="email" id="testEmailRecipient" placeholder="Nhập email nhận thử (vd: hieudzzzggg@gmail.com)" class="flex-1 glass-input rounded-xl p-2 text-white placeholder-slate-500" />
                                <button type="button" id="btnTestEmail" onclick="handleTestGateway('EMAIL')" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-purple-600/30 hover:bg-purple-600 border border-purple-500/40 text-purple-200 hover:text-white font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane mr-1"></i> Gửi thử
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Cột 2: Cấu hình SMS Twilio -->
                    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-pink-500/30 space-y-3.5">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-bold text-pink-300 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-comment-sms text-pink-400"></i> 2. Cấu hình SMS (Twilio API)
                            </span>
                            <span id="modalSmsStatusBadge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-semibold">Chưa cấu hình</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/10 border border-pink-500/20 text-[11px] text-slate-300 space-y-1">
                            <p class="font-semibold text-pink-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1"></i> Hướng dẫn lấy khóa SMS Twilio:</p>
                            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-0.5 text-slate-400">
                                <li>Đăng nhập <a href="https://console.twilio.com" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-400 underline hover:text-cyan-300 font-semibold">console.twilio.com</a> để lấy <b>Account SID</b> & <b>Auth Token</b>.</li>
                                <li>Hệ thống tự động chuyển SĐT Việt Nam (<code>0886...</code>) sang chuẩn quốc tế (<code>+84886...</code>).</li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">Twilio Account SID</label>
                            <input type="text" id="cfgSmsAccountSid" placeholder="VD: ACxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 font-mono" />
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">Twilio Auth Token</label>
                            <input type="password" id="cfgSmsAuthToken" placeholder="Nhập Auth Token từ Twilio Console" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 font-mono" />
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1">Số điện thoại gửi đi (Twilio Phone Number)</label>
                            <input type="text" id="cfgSmsFromPhone" placeholder="VD: +12565550199" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl p-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 font-mono" />
                        </div>

                        <!-- Gửi thử SMS -->
                        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-white/10">
                            <label class="block text-slate-400 mb-1">Gửi thử SMS kiểm tra tới SĐT:</label>
                            <div class="flex gap-2">
                                <input type="text" id="testSmsRecipient" placeholder="Nhập SĐT nhận thử (vd: 0886091716)" class="flex-1 glass-input rounded-xl p-2 text-white placeholder-slate-500" />
                                <button type="button" id="btnTestSms" onclick="handleTestGateway('SMS')" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-pink-600/30 hover:bg-pink-600 border border-pink-500/40 text-pink-200 hover:text-white font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane mr-1"></i> Gửi thử
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="gatewayConfigFeedback" class="hidden p-3.5 rounded-xl border text-xs font-medium"></div>

                <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-end space-x-3">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeModal('gatewayConfigModal')" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-slate-300 font-semibold transition">
                        Đóng
                    </button>
                    <button type="submit" id="saveGatewayConfigBtn" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-pink-500 text-white font-bold shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30 flex items-center space-x-2 transition">
                        <i id="saveGatewaySpinner" class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch fa-spin hidden"></i>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i>
                        <span>Lưu cấu hình Gmail & SMS</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal: Hồ sơ cá nhân người dùng đang đăng nhập -->
    <div id="userProfileModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-md z-50 flex items-center justify-center hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 p-4">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-white/20 w-full max-w-md p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-2xl relative transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300">
            <button type="button" onclick="closeModal('userProfileModal')" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="text-center pb-5 border-b border-white/10">
                <div class="relative inline-block">
                    <img src="@userAvatar" alt="@userFullName" class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl mx-auto object-cover ring-4 ring-purple-500/40 shadow-xl shadow-purple-600/30 mb-3">
                    <span class="absolute bottom-2 right-0 w-4 h-4 bg-emerald-500 border-2 border-slate-900 rounded-full"></span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">@userFullName</h3>
                <span class="inline-block mt-1 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/30">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved mr-1"></i> @roleBadge
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="py-4 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-slate-400">Tên đăng nhập:</span>
                    <strong class="text-white">@(User.Identity?.Name ?? "Chưa rõ")</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-slate-400">Email:</span>
                    <strong class="text-white">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(userEmail) ? "Chưa cập nhật" : userEmail)</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-slate-400">Số điện thoại:</span>
                    <strong class="text-white">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(userPhone) ? "Chưa cập nhật" : userPhone)</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-3 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-end space-x-2">
                <button type="button" onclick="closeModal('userProfileModal')" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-slate-300 font-semibold text-xs transition">Đóng</button>
                <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="ChangePassword" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30 transition">Đổi mật khẩu</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal: Thêm Mới Khách Hàng (Dark Glassmorphism) -->
    <div id="addCustomerModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-md z-50 flex items-center justify-center hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 p-4">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl border border-white/20 w-full max-w-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl relative transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
            <!-- Nút đóng -->
            <button type="button" onclick="closeModal('addCustomerModal')" class="absolute top-5 right-5 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xl"></i>
            </button>

            <!-- Tiêu đề Modal -->
            <div class="mb-6 border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 to-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span>Thêm Mới Khách Hàng</span>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Khởi tạo hồ sơ khách hàng mới và đồng bộ trực tiếp vào cơ sở dữ liệu SalonCare CRM.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Khung thông báo lỗi trong modal (nếu có) -->
            <div id="customerFormError" class="hidden mb-4 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/20 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-300 text-xs flex items-center space-x-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-base text-rose-400 shrink-0"></i>
                <span id="customerFormErrorMsg">Vui lòng kiểm tra lại thông tin.</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Form Nhập Liệu 2 Cột -->
            <form id="createCustomerForm" onsubmit="handleCreateCustomerSubmit(event)" class="space-y-5 text-xs">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    
                    <!-- CỘT 1: THÔNG TIN CÁ NHÂN CƠ BẢN -->
                    <div class="space-y-3.5">
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 pb-1.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i> 1. Thông tin cá nhân
                        </h4>

                        <!-- Họ và tên -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">
                                Họ và tên <span class="text-pink-400">*</span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-user absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-500"></i>
                                <input type="text" id="custFullName" required placeholder="VD: Nguyễn Thị Lan" 
                                    class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl pl-9 pr-3.5 py-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-purple-500" />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Số điện thoại -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">
                                Số điện thoại <span class="text-pink-400">*</span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-phone absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-500"></i>
                                <input type="tel" id="custPhone" required placeholder="VD: 0901234567 hoặc +84901234567" 
                                    class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl pl-9 pr-3.5 py-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-purple-500" />
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1 block">Hỗ trợ 10 số (Việt Nam) phục vụ SMS/Zalo Automation.</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Email -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">
                                Địa chỉ Email <span class="text-slate-500 font-normal">(Tùy chọn)</span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-500"></i>
                                <input type="email" id="custEmail" placeholder="VD: lan.nguyen@example.com" 
                                    class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl pl-9 pr-3.5 py-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-purple-500" />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Giới tính & Ngày sinh (Hàng đôi) -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Giới tính</label>
                                <select id="custGender" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-white bg-slate-900 border-white/10">
                                    <option value="Nữ" selected>Nữ</option>
                                    <option value="Nam">Nam</option>
                                    <option value="Khác">Khác</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Ngày sinh</label>
                                <input type="date" id="custDob" 
                                    class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-white bg-slate-900 border-white/10" />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Địa chỉ -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Địa chỉ liên hệ</label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-500"></i>
                                <input type="text" id="custAddress" placeholder="VD: 123 Nguyễn Trãi, P.3, Q.5, TP.HCM" 
                                    class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl pl-9 pr-3.5 py-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-purple-500" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- CỘT 2: THÔNG TIN CRM & PHÂN LOẠI -->
                    <div class="space-y-3.5">
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-pink-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 pb-1.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i> 2. Phân loại & Nguồn khách
                        </h4>

                        <!-- Nguồn khách -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Nguồn tiếp cận</label>
                            <select id="custSource" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-white bg-slate-900 border-white/10">
                                <option value="Truc_tiep" selected>Vãng lai / Trực tiếp</option>
                                <option value="Facebook">Facebook Ads / Fanpage</option>
                                <option value="TikTok">TikTok Video</option>
                                <option value="Zalo">Zalo OA</option>
                                <option value="Gioi_thieu">Người quen giới thiệu</option>
                                <option value="Khac">Nguồn khác</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phân loại khách & Trạng thái (Hàng đôi) -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Hạng khách hàng</label>
                                <select id="custType" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-white bg-slate-900 border-white/10">
                                    <option value="Moi" selected>Mới (New)</option>
                                    <option value="Than_thiet">Thân thiết (Loyal)</option>
                                    <option value="VIP">VIP Spender</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Trạng thái hồ sơ</label>
                                <select id="custStatus" class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-white bg-slate-900 border-white/10">
                                    <option value="Hoat_dong" selected>Hoạt động</option>
                                    <option value="Ngung_hoat_dong">Tạm ngừng</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Avatar URL -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Link ảnh đại diện (Avatar URL)</label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-image absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-500"></i>
                                <input type="url" id="custAvatarUrl" placeholder="https://images.unsplash.com/..." 
                                    class="w-full glass-input rounded-xl pl-9 pr-3.5 py-2.5 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-purple-500" />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Ghi chú ban đầu -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-slate-300 mb-1 font-semibold">Ghi chú & Tình trạng da / Sở thích</label>
